<title>UK: CRICKET-LEICESTERSHIRE 62-4 V AUSTRALIA (220-8 DEC) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-LEICESTERSHIRE 62-4 V AUSTRALIA (220-8 DEC) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>LEICESTER, England 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leicestershire, replying to Australia's first innings 220 for eight declared, were 62 for four when rain ended play on the second day of the three day tour match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
